{"id":"051b1a34c565ddef","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md","title":"C*-Algebra","display":"df-cstar-algebra — C*-Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cstar-algebra","aliases":["58-df-cstar-algebra","C*-Algebra","58-df-zfc-analysis2-cstar-algebra"],"display":"df-cstar-algebra — C*-Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-involution.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cstar-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cstar-algebra</span><span>C*-Algebra</span><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-cstar-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cstar-algebra — C*-Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73fea4849a6b9741\" href=\"?note=73fea4849a6b9741\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-involution.md\">../batch10/58-df-involution.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in V\">\\(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"630c319f5a2106ce\" href=\"?note=630c319f5a2106ce\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md\">../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Involution}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Involution}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"73fea4849a6b9741\" href=\"?note=73fea4849a6b9741\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-involution.md\">../batch10/58-df-involution.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot:\\mathbb C\\times A\\to A\">\\(\\odot:\\mathbb C\\times A\\to A\\)</span> 在正文量化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot:A\\times A\\to A\">\\(\\cdot:A\\times A\\to A\\)</span> 是代数乘法，二者不混用。二元运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(a,b)\">\\(q(a,b)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\">\\(q(\\langle a,b\\rangle)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S\\)</span> 为所引文件的五元接口。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cstar\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\odot\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+,\\odot,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Involution}_S(*,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl[\n*(+(a,b))=+(*(a),*(b))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land*(\\odot(\\lambda,a))=\\odot(\\overline\\lambda,*(a))\n\\land*(\\cdot(a,b))=\\cdot(*(b),*(a))\n\\land\\|\\cdot(*(a),a)\\|=\\|a\\|^2\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cstar\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\odot\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+,\\odot,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Involution}_S(*,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl[\n*(+(a,b))=+(*(a),*(b))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land*(\\odot(\\lambda,a))=\\odot(\\overline\\lambda,*(a))\n\\land*(\\cdot(a,b))=\\cdot(*(b),*(a))\n\\land\\|\\cdot(*(a),a)\\|=\\|a\\|^2\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span>-algebra: Banach *-algebra with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span>-identity</li>\n<li>Gelfand transform: commutative <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span>-algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong C_0(\\Omega)\">\\(\\cong C_0(\\Omega)\\)</span></li>\n<li>GNS construction: states give representations</li>\n<li>Positivity: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a \\geq 0\">\\(a \\geq 0\\)</span> iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a = b^*b\">\\(a = b^*b\\)</span></li>\n<li>Functional calculus: continuous functions of self-adjoint elements</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Murphy, C*-Algebras and Operator Theory</li>\n<li>Davidson, C*-Algebras by Example</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-involution.md","status":"resolved","id":"73fea4849a6b9741","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-involution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"630c319f5a2106ce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-banach-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-involution.md","status":"resolved","id":"73fea4849a6b9741","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Involution}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-involution.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BanachAlg}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Involution}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\odot:\\mathbb C\\times A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot:A\\times A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"q(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"q(\\langle a,b\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cstar\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\odot\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{BanachAlgStructure}_S(A,+,\\odot,\\cdot,\\|\\cdot\\|)\n\\land\\mathrm{Involution}_S(*,A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl[\n*(+(a,b))=+(*(a),*(b))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land*(\\odot(\\lambda,a))=\\odot(\\overline\\lambda,*(a))\n\\land*(\\cdot(a,b))=\\cdot(*(b),*(a))\n\\land\\|\\cdot(*(a),a)\\|=\\|a\\|^2\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"C^*","display":false},{"tex":"C^*","display":false},{"tex":"C^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong C_0(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"a \\geq 0","display":false},{"tex":"a = b^*b","display":false}],"bytes":1731,"backlinks":[{"id":"7ca5c842625f1295","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,0_A,1_A,a,b\\in V\\land\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+,\\cdot,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md]])"},{"id":"9ec14d57629b7a4c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9068f8953ee2e56","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|,1_A\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{CStarAlg}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,*,\\|\\cdot\\|)$ as in [[58-df-cstar-algebra]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-385","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-cstar-algebra.md|58-df-cstar-algebra]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["630c319f5a2106ce","73fea4849a6b9741"]}